{
  "id": "JER.36",
  "number": "36",
  "bookId": "JER",
  "reference": "Yeremiya 36",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baruku ghoasoamwa gitaabu aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba ang'wan bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yehoyakimu orjeeda Yosiya sugoocheanda Yuda, hean ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya ak gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Geani gitaabu ak ging'oorsi jeeda ng'asheega sean ghayi earukuneey aba badayda fuga Israeli, ea fuga Yuda, ea eemoojiga sean, ghang'eada eaweedida ghayi eabaloolaneeyiin, ghang'eada damanda ghayi bea Yosiya ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwadeepa fuga Yuda ghwayiiy ng'asheega munyas sean jea dasima saawa, ak gaba nih abuut naweadingaaschi munyas ak geasamsi giidiinyeanyeeka nyaawa ea riing'eega nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'ata gaguursa Yeremiya Baruku orjeeda Neriya, hean ghang'oar Baruku ng'asheega sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA leabu ghuuta Yeremiya ghayi rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yeremiya Baruku, “Aniini siweadanaani beata jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi una, ak giisoami gitaabwajeanda ing'oorsi jeeda ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA leabu ghuuteanyu, ak giisoami ghwayiiy buuneeda aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA. Nea eaweeda jea radana gajasoamwana ghwayiiy fuga sean bea Yuda, leabu jeeda mujiinajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwadeepa ghamwaash NG'UTAMIIDA nyaawa ak gaba nih abuut naweadingaaschi muy, aba gideaba nyarasta ea ng'weaninda ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA aba badaydeaba fiisu aahaw muuchi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Baruku orjeeda Neriya iidu gwasinda ng'asheesu seaniin gidarukusiinda Yeremiya was sibaneeda. Ak ghoasoamwa aba jeeda gitaabu ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweaydeaba muut bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yehoyakimu orjeeda Yosiya, sugoocheanda Yuda, nea sheedeaba shageash gil, fuga sean mida Yerusalemu, ea fuga sean fuga Yerusalemu leabu mujiinajeega sean bea Yuda, hean geerukuta giiluuldeaydeaba geat aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoasoamwa Baruku ng'asheega Yeremiya aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA bea NG'UTAMIIDA, aba jeeda ghooriida Gemariya orjeeda Shafani was ng'oorshoocheanda, nea aba jeeda doodooda mida heetiyeada gil, bea naweeda gidaghuuteesh bea gheeda sibata ASEETA, hean ghoasoamwa nea ghwayiiy buuneesean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gitaabu geasoamwa aba madeeda fuga hees",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Mikaya orjeeda Gemariya orjeeda Shafani iidu nea ghwayiiy ng'asheega sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA mida jeedeaba gitaabwajeandida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwararang'aada ak gawa jeeda gheeda sugoocheanda, jeeda ghooriida ng'oorshoocheanda, nea abeeda ea niibiitbiit fuga hees aba jeedida, nea geaba Elishama gil was ng'oorshoocheanda, ea Delaya, orjeeda Shemaya, ea Elinatani orjeeda Akbori, ea Gemariya orjeeda Shafani, ea Sedekiya orjeeda Hananiya, ea fuga hees sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa Mikaya saawa ng'asheega sean iiy damanda asoamwa Baruku gitaabu aba madeeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta fuga hees sean Yehudi, orjeeda Netaniya orjeeda Sheleniya orjeeda Gushi, gawa heeda Baruku gwayeesha, “Geani gitaabwajeanda ghayi iisoami aba madeeda buuneeda ak giyeadu hiji.” Hean gageanu Baruku orjeeda Neriya gitaabu ak gweasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeyeesha niny, “Apteada ak giisoami.” Hean ghoasoamwa Baruku aba madeanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea geayiiy ng'asheesu seaniin, gaba nih ang'weersa nuut aba muuwda, ak geeyeesha Baruku, “Ng'asheesu seaniin gajeerukusiina sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geanyaash Baruku nea geeyeesha, “Heapi ng'asheesu seaniin giimuustiin ng'oara? Inyeesa gwarukuneey Yeremiya ak ging'waari?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha Baruku nea gwayeesha, “Ng'asheesu seaniin gwarukunean niny aba ghuutaanyi ak geang'oorsi jeeda gitaabu aba galaamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fugiga heesiin Baruku, “Una funya geaw, ang'iing'i ea Yeremiya, nea adaghwanal sih heeda oondi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda ghaghwarda gitaabwajeanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeweay heeda sugoocheanda ak geeweay gah, nea abeeda gitaabwajeandida ea siyiin jeeda ghooriida Elishama was ng'oorshoocheanda, ak geerukusa ng'asheesu seaniin sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeakta sugoocheanda Yehudi gawa ghamwaghaada gitaabu, ak gawa gageanu aba jeeda ghooriida Elishama was ng'oorshoocheanda. Hean ghoasoamwa Yehudi nea gooleeysiit sugoocheanda ea fuga hees miinaada aba madeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damandida ea sheedang'wan gil, ak sugoocheanda abeeda gwanda jeedeaba gheanyi gwaju beasta rarayga aba gideaba damanda gooroogeeda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata nea niisoamwa Yehudi meatkwaji samwagu ea ang'wan bea gitaabwajeanda, hean ghoang'waay sugoocheanda ghwalajaada gitaabwajeandida aba barda ak gwajaksa jeeda beasta rarayga ak ghwaak beasta ea goosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mabeala nea mabwaashaada hang'weaka nyaawa, sugoocheanda ghana fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, iiy ng'asheesu seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda Elinatani, ea Delaya, ea Gemariya, ea simearmear sugoocheanda gideaba adaghaghwarda gitaabwajeandida ak ea mamwasa ghwayiiy iita nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakta sugoocheanda Yerameli orjeeda sugoocheanda, ea Seraya orjeeda Asrieli ea Shelemiya, orjeeda Abdeeli eang'waay Baruku was ng'oorshoocheanda ea Yeremiya was sibaneeda, ak ghafuy NG'UTAMIIDA saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata nea nighwarda sugoocheanda gitaabwajeandida bea ng'asheega ghayi ng'oar Baruku aba gidarukusiinda Yeremiya. Hean gawa ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya ak gwayeesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi geani gitaabwajeanda nuut ak ging'oorsi jeeda ng'asheega sean bea mwadi sean ghayi mida jeeda gitaabwajeandida bea mwadiin ak ghaghwarda Yehoyakimu was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina Yehoyakimu sugoocheanda Yuda gideaba ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ghamneawa nighwardi gitaabwajeandida, gaydaanyaashnyi gideaba, “Ghwasaan anda Yeremiya ghang'oar gideaba sugoocheanda Babeli gayghwahidu gwanyarja ng'eanyiini nea ghwalas uhuuda buuneeda ea diyeanga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Yehoyakimu sugoocheanda Yuda aba jeadaanyi manda siida jea gawa hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda Dawdi, nea mustaanyi gajeejaksa jarooda askweari ak ghwaak daknooda nea eawa ghwaak jeameeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydalas niny ea jeataanyi ea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, aba badayda giidiinyeanyeeka nyaawa, ak gaydeadu ng'asheega munyas sean badayda nyaawa, ea badayda fuga Yerusalemu, ea fuga Yuda aba gideaba mamwasa gwayiing'shi.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
